---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy - Randomlyo';
const description = 'Privacy policy for Randomlyo. Learn about how we protect your data.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-safe max-w-3xl prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-12">Last updated: September 2025</p>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">1. Overview</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          Randomlyo ("we" or "us" or "our") operates the Randomlyo website (the "Service").
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our Service and the choices you have associated with that data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">2. Information Collection and Use</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <strong>We collect very limited information.</strong> Most of Randomlyo's tools process data entirely on your device and we do not store or transmit this data.
        </p>
        
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">2.1 Client-Side Processing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          When you use our randomization tools (picker wheel, dice roller, number generator, etc.), all processing happens in your browser. We do not:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
          <li>Collect names, lists, or options you enter</li>
          <li>Store randomization results or selections</li>
          <li>Track which tools you use</li>
          <li>Collect timing or frequency data</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">2.2 Analytics</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We may use analytics to understand which tools are popular and how users interact with the website (not individual results). This helps us improve Randomlyo.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Analytics data is anonymized and aggregated. We do not track individual users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">3. Cookies</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Randomlyo does not use cookies to track you or store personal information. Your browser's local storage or session storage may be used to remember your preferences, but this is stored locally on your device, not transmitted to us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">4. Security</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          The security of your data is important to us. Since most Randomlyo tools process data locally on your device, there is minimal risk of data loss.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          However, no method of transmission over the Internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your Personal Data, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">5. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
          We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date at the top.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4">
          <a href="mailto:hello@randomlyo.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hello@randomlyo.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
